                        <locus target="#16v">-16v</locus>وَجَعَلْنَا بَعْضَكُمْ لِبَعْضٍ فِتْنَةً أَتَصْبِرُوْنَ وَكَانَ رَبُّكَ بَصِيْراً</explicit>
                     <note>23:1-25:20.  Ihmāl signs (rā’s). 11 lines a page. Rubricated title of suras. Takbīr (9r). Words completed the following line in almost all folios. Irregular catchwords, almost all by the same hand. Deletions and corrections.</note>
